= Toxteth

In July the riots spread: Toxteth in Liverpool, Moss Side in Manchester, Handsworth in Birmingham and dozens of smaller towns. In Toxteth the police use CS gas on the mainland for the first time.

- @minister_for_merseyside: Send Michael Heseltine to Liverpool.
- @managed_decline: Let the city decline: we can't throw money at it.

@minister_for_merseyside
on-arrival: budget -= 1; wet_dissent -= 5; de_con += 1*(1-dissent); dry_dissent += 3

Heseltine spends three weeks in Liverpool with bankers and businessmen, and comes back with a plan for urban regeneration. The dries see it as a spending spree.

@managed_decline
on-arrival: dry_dissent -= 3; wet_dissent += 5; de_con -= 2; de_lab += 2

The Treasury argues that the money would be better spent elsewhere. If word of the argument ever leaks, Liverpool won't forgive it.
